"notes": {"items":"IDs are equipment-array indices, not save/localization IDs. textId is display provenance only.","moves":"Move IDs are local to a native character/form. Unresolved rows are marked.","rules":"id is the stored one-based rule selector. Zero means no rule text. Rule labels alone do not implement an effect.","actions":"IDs are native action detectors. Only text IDs 0..107 supply corresponding labels; controller glyph strings 108+ are not action names.","forms":"Native slots determine the action/animation. Preset links determine destination appearance and equipment. Null target means unused native slot.","objectives":"Original label bindings, not a complete tested recipe for every condition.","battleZoneMusic":"Stock Battle Zone chooses music from native stage-type pools and special last-zone cases; the MMD music word does not select the track."},
